# NOTE: do not exclude any of the following, the image needs them:
#   enterprise/        config/application.rb adds enterprise/lib, enterprise/listeners
#                      and enterprise/app/** to eager_load_paths unconditionally, so
#                      Rails cannot boot in production without the directory. Excluding
#                      it broke `rake assets:precompile` at boot. DISABLE_ENTERPRISE
#                      does not help: it only affects ChatwootApp.enterprise?.
#   vite.config.ts / vite.shared.ts / vite.lib.config.ts   vite build reads them
#   tailwind.config.js / postcss.config.js / theme/        CSS pipeline; the tailwind
#                      config imports ./theme/colors and ./theme/icons
#   .browserslistrc    consumed by the frontend build
#   data/              20260815000005_import_vehicle_prices_from_csv reads
#                      data/vehicle_prices.csv; without it the migration silently skips
#   swagger/           served at runtime by the /swagger routes

